'''Drifloon''' (Japanese: '''フワンテ''' ''Fuwante'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Mega Rising}} expansion.

