==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Ultra Prism|Drifloon|51}} from the {{TCG|Ultra Prism}} expansion.
*'''Wind Blast''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Plasma Blast|Drifloon|34}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Blast}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

